        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-16T06:20:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Interesting.&nbsp; I've yet to try a 1-hero game, though I persist in my belief that Nightmist is probably capable of defeating at least some villains single-handedly.&nbsp; It's neat that you can do this with Vengeance, even if it's probably only slightly less pear-shaped than a normal game.&nbsp; I would definitely not be above trying it sometime.</p>",
