        "id": 91523,
        "name": "MCPooge",
        "username": "MCPooge",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/bb73d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-16T08:14:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've enjoyed attempting this quite a lot lately, actually. The only time I managed to win, however, was the Sentinels vs Fright Train. I have tried so many Knyfe vs Proletariat, and every time I just come soooo close, but have never managed to edge out the win.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Though it sometimes seems impossible to win, I still think it is a lot of fun, and it makes me think of the tough one-on-one fights so often seen in comics.</p>",
