        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Interesting.&nbsp; I've yet to try a 1-hero game, though I persist in my belief that Nightmist is probably capable of defeating at least some villains single-handedly.&nbsp; It's neat that you can do this with Vengeance, even if it's probably only slightly less pear-shaped than a normal game.&nbsp; I would definitely not be above trying it sometime.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Nightmist can beat Voss, and plague rat, since they don't destroy your cards, so you can mistform and heal up, drop it and destroy everything.</p>",
